    <main>
        <section class="shell hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Built for growing local businesses</span><h1 id="hero-heading">Run your shop with clarity, not clutter.</h1><p class="lead">{{ config('app.name', 'POS') }} brings your sales, inventory, products, and team together in one straightforward point-of-sale system.</p><div class="actions">@auth <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ route('dashboard') }}">Open your dashboard →</a> @else <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ route('register') }}">Create your account →</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="#features">Explore features</a> @endauth</div><div class="proof"><span>Fast checkout</span><span>Live inventory</span><span>Team-ready</span></div></div><figure class="dashboard" aria-label="{{ config('app.name', 'POS') }} dashboard product preview with illustrative data"><div class="screen"><div class="product-bar"><div class="product-brand"><span>▣</span>{{ config('app.name', 'POS') }}</div><i class="product-user"></i></div><div class="screen-body"><aside class="side"><a class="active">Dashboard</a><a>Products</a><a>Sales</a><a>Point of Sale</a><a>Analytics</a></aside><div class="workspace"><div class="workspace-head"><div><div class="screen-title">Dashboard</div><div class="screen-sub">Your shop at a glance</div></div><span class="date-chip">Today</span></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><small>Total Revenue</small><strong>₱24,580</strong><span class="up">↑ 12% this week</span></div><div class="stat"><small>Total Orders</small><strong>128</strong><span class="up">↑ 8% this week</span></div><div class="stat stock-alert"><small>Low Stock</small><strong>6 items</strong><span class="up">Needs attention</span></div><div class="stat"><small>Avg. Order</small><strong>₱192</strong><span class="up">↑ 4% this week</span></div></div><div class="activity"><h3>Recent Stock Activity</h3><div class="activity-row"><i class="activity-icon"></i><div class="activity-copy"><b>Iced Coffee · Medium</b><span>Stock received</span></div><span class="activity-value">+24</span></div><div class="activity-row"><i class="activity-icon"></i><div class="activity-copy"><b>Milk Tea · Vanilla</b><span>Sale completed</span></div><span class="activity-value">−3</span></div></div></div></div></div><figcaption>Product preview — illustrative data only</figcaption></figure></section>
        <section id="features" class="walkthrough" data-active="checkout" aria-labelledby="features-heading"><div class="shell"><div class="walkthrough-heading"><span class="kicker">Everything in one place</span><h2 id="features-heading">Follow a smoother day at the counter.</h2><p>Scroll through the tools that keep sales moving, stock accurate, and your next decision close at hand.</p></div><div class="walkthrough-grid"><div class="walkthrough-steps"><article class="feature-step is-active" data-feature="checkout"><i class="step-number" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">01 · Sell</span><h3>Finish every sale without breaking the flow.</h3><p>Keep your popular products, order details, and checkout action together so the queue keeps moving.</p><span class="step-detail">A focused checkout workspace</span></div></article><article class="feature-step" data-feature="inventory"><i class="step-number" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">02 · Stock</span><h3>See what is on the shelf before you need it.</h3><p>Track stock by product and make replenishment decisions from a clear, current view of your inventory.</p><span class="step-detail">Stock levels at a glance</span></div></article><article class="feature-step" data-feature="alerts"><i class="step-number" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">03 · Act</span><h3>Catch low stock before it costs a sale.</h3><p>Give attention to the products that need it, with clear alerts instead of surprise empty shelves.</p><span class="step-detail">Practical, timely reminders</span></div></article><article class="feature-step" data-feature="reports"><i class="step-number" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">04 · Learn</span><h3>Turn daily sales into your next smart move.</h3><p>See revenue and order trends in a simple dashboard your whole team can understand.</p><span class="step-detail">Useful reporting, without the spreadsheet</span></div></article></div>
