<i></i></span><span class="stock-count">8 left</span></div><div class="inventory-row"><i class="thumb"></i><div><b>Chocolate Cake Slice</b><small>SKU CC-SLC</small></div><span class="stock-bar"><i></i></span><span class="stock-count">24 left</span></div></div></div><div class="walk-screen walk-screen--alerts"><h4>Needs attention</h4><p>Know the products to restock before your shelves are empty.</p><div class="alert-card"><h5>3 items are running low</h5><p>Review low stock products and prepare your next order.</p><div class="alert-list"><div class="alert-row"><i class="alert-dot"></i><b>Butter Croissant</b><span>8 left</span></div><div class="alert-row"><i class="alert-dot"></i><b>Oat Milk</b><span>5 left</span></div><div class="alert-row"><i class="alert-dot"></i><b>Vanilla Syrup</b><span>3 left</span></div></div><span class="alert-action">Review low stock →</span></div></div><div class="walk-screen walk-screen--reports"><h4>Sales overview</h4><p>Make the next decision with a clear view of performance.</p><div class="report-metrics"><div class="metric"><small>Today’s sales</small><strong>₱24,580</strong><span>↑ 12.4%</span></div><div class="metric"><small>Orders</small><strong>128</strong><span>↑ 8.1%</span></div><div class="metric"><small>Average order</small><strong>₱192</strong><span>↑ 4.2%</span></div></div><div class="chart" aria-label="Illustrative weekly sales chart"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
